SHOWCASE REPOSITORY

This repository contains documentation, figures, result summaries, demonstration
outputs, and selected source excerpts describing the PGX Pipeline. It is
published for portfolio and evaluation purposes.

You may view, read, and reference this material, including citing it with
attribution.

You may not redistribute, republish, sublicense, sell, or incorporate this
material or the code excerpts it contains into another product or work without
prior written authorization from the copyright holder.

The full PGX Pipeline source code is not included in this repository and is not
licensed for any use by its absence here.

THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

The pipeline described here interoperates with external tools and knowledge
bases (including GATK, Ensembl VEP, Strelka2, DeepVariant, Octopus, CNVkit,
ExomeDepth, CODEX2, panelcn.MOPS, PLINK2, PyPGx, ClinPGX, CPIC, PharmGKB,
PharmVar, DPWG, ClinVar, gnomAD, GeneBe, DGV, and DECIPHER). Each carries its
own license and citation requirements and is governed by those terms, not by
this one. No third-party database content is redistributed in this repository.

DATA

All data shown in this repository — every figure, demo page, table, and example
— is synthetic. No patient data, and no data derived from patient samples, is
present.

